# own grace allowance; the caffeinate assertion being released on app
# termination; and four support-log blindnesses (redacted timestamps, missing
# tool output, an unreachable watchdog overlay, an unreachable sidebar failure
# glyph).
#
# MEASURED, not estimated -- but measured LOCALLY, which is the difference from
# the raises above. Run on this branch with the same command swift-tests.yml
# uses (xcodebuild build-for-testing then test-without-building, scheme
# OstlerInstaller, platform=macOS) and scored with this repo's own
# scripts/verify_swift_tests_ran.sh, which printed
#     swift-tests: executed=374 failures=0 declared-floor=318
# The pre-change baseline on the same box printed 338, so the floor was already
